{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:27fcc9e886ed5a6d","name":"Cybernetic Surgery","source":{"id":"source:reference-27fcc9e886ed5a6d","title":"Cybernetic Surgery","revision":18076,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:33:06Z","sha256":"08571bf0b4f4cb44c091deb7b4f438689acce5fed2a8ad19f32a6e33db2db3e9","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18076","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Cybernetic%20Surgery&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-27fcc9e886ed5a6d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can perform the surgical procedures necessary to graft cybernetic components onto living flesh.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," You can install ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cybernetic Prostheses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cybernetic_Prostheses"}," on living beings. The surgical procedure takes 1 hour of uninterrupted work, after which you must make a DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," check. If the check succeeds, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cybernetic Prosthesis"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cybernetic_Prosthesis","referenceId":"reference:06abec99ed18263b"}," is installed correctly. If the check fails, the device is not properly installed; however, you can try again after another uninterrupted hour of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surgery"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surgery"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," You can install a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cybernetic Prosthesis"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cybernetic_Prosthesis","referenceId":"reference:06abec99ed18263b"}," on yourself, but you take a -5 penalty on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," skill check. If you have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surgical Expertise"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surgical_Expertise","referenceId":"reference:395f2bbe479502d2"}," feat, you can install a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cybernetic Prosthesis"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cybernetic_Prosthesis","referenceId":"reference:06abec99ed18263b"}," in 10 minutes instead of 1 hour.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
